      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Something me and some peeps just found out as we tried to troubleshoot it.\nBasically, GameObjects that are a child to the Root (same level as Armature, Body, ..) seem to get turned on when you are in that specific avatar AND previewing it in the menu. Components do net get turned on/off.\nTo reproduce it, upload literally anything with some GameObjects that have e.g. meshes in it or something else, disable the GameObjects before upload.\nThe fix/workaround for now is this -> Disable Skinned Mesh Renderer instead of the GameObject.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
